ferrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\"></details><br><hr><br><br><span class=\"size-bigger\"><b>Credits:</b></span><br>- Jaydee and Roflos for help with coding.<br>- Michael Hendricks for showing me RGB mods in Factorio, which originally inspired this mod",
