  "discordPostHtml": "<p>RGB Combat? RGB Combat!!! Pretty rainbows or true gamer experience? It's for you to decide, I just done cool thing which I like myself.</p><p>Forum page: <a href=\"https://fractalsoftworks.com/forum/index.php?topic=35865\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\">https://fractalsoftworks.com/forum/index.php?topic=35865</a></p><p>Download: <a href=\"https://github.com/Vexlia-Artemiss/RGB-combat/releases/latest/download/RGB.combat.zip\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\">https://github.com/Vexlia-Artemiss/RGB-combat/releases/latest/download/RGB.combat.zip</a><br>Requires Lunalib</p><p>So what it does? Pretty much adds RGB to everything I thought makes sense in combat.<br>Current list:</p><ul><li>RGB projectiles</li><li>RGB missiles</li><li>RGB beams</li><li>RGB shields</li><li>RGB venting</li><li>RGB overload</li><li>RGB engines</li><li>Disco Background</li></ul><p>With highly customisable LunaLib settings to tweak everything to your liking</p>",
